           arrives. Icons are lucide-static 1.31.0, copied verbatim. The viewBox runs
           from the first label's baseline (its letters rise above it,
           overflow visible) to the slab's shadow, so those are the edges
           that line up with the copy: the headline's baseline, the foot of
           the buttons. -->
