        <h2 id="h-ds">A design system for everyone</h2>
        <p class="lead">The Rastrillo design system is a robust design system using elegant, semantic markup to create usable baseline styles for your apps.</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>Get good-looking admin screens out of the box</li>
          <li>A full set of configurable design tokens</li>
          <li>A host of the most common components</li>
          <li>Light: &lt;20KiB gzipped</li>
          <li>WCAG AA 2.2 accessibility audit-ready</li>
          <li>Proper hierarchy-based mobile navigation</li>
        </ul>
