      <div class="body">
        <h2 id="h-deploy">Deployment</h2>
        <p class="lead">Rastrillo apps compile to a single binary, so they will run trivially on any deployment stack. For fast-simple CARLOS-native deployment, reach for <a href="https://carlosframework.com/platform/">CARLOS platform</a>, and to get started immediately, use <a href="https://carloku.com">Carloku</a>.</p>
        <fieldset class="paths">
          <legend class="sr">Choose how to deploy</legend>
          <input type="radio" name="dep-path" id="dep-agent" checked>
          <label for="dep-agent">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2"/><path d="M20 14h2"/><path d="M15 13v2"/><path d="M9 13v2"/></svg>
            With an agent</label>
          <input type="radio" name="dep-path" id="dep-hand">
          <label for="dep-hand">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19h8"/><path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6"/></svg>
            By hand</label>

          <div class="panel panel-agent">
            <p>Ask your agent:</p>
            <div class="prompt">
              <pre id="deploy-prompt">Deploy this app to Carloku</pre>
              <button class="copy" type="button" hidden aria-label="Copy prompt" title="Copy prompt" data-for="deploy-prompt">
                <svg class="i-copy" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg>
                <svg class="i-done" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
              </button>
              <span class="sr" role="status"></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel panel-hand">
              <ol class="steps">
                <li>
                  <span class="basin-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
                  <div>
                    <h3>Install the platform binary</h3>
                    <pre class="cmd"><code><span class="k">brew</span> install carlosframework/tap/carlos</code></pre>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="basin-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
                  <div>
                    <h3>Build your app for the target host</h3>
                    <pre class="cmd"><code>GOOS=linux GOARCH=arm64 <span class="k">go</span> build -o myapp ./cmd/myapp</code></pre>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="basin-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
                  <div>
                    <h3>Deploy it</h3>
                    <pre class="cmd"><code><span class="k">carlos</span> deploy --app myapp ./myapp</code></pre>
                    <p>Ships, promotes and watches your hosts until the new build is live.</p>
                  </div>
                </li>
              </ol>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 8. Features -->
    <section class="sec g-raked" aria-labelledby="h-feat">
      <svg class="mo " viewBox="0 0 240 150" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
